  (:adr/related
   (vector "adr-2609200440-qwen38-27b-whitehacker-red-route-published-deepseek-nex-pruned (直前の red route 作業。flash-next の RTX PRO 6000 実測 1,795 tok/s と B300 spec/cost 比較はここ)"
